      "shortName": "context-menu-4",
      "title": "context-menu-4: Migration onto OverlayHost::open_dropdown",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "Both open_context_menu/open_sidebar_context_menu (mouse.rs) build a DropdownSpec + open via OverlayHost::open_dropdown (host-owned Overlay-band modal layer). Removed the whole bespoke path: AppState.context_menu + context_menu_action sink, 3 events.rs input branches + context_menu_open/settle_context_menu, chrome/mod.rs layout_context_menu/paint_context_menu + hint blocks + render.rs calls (layout_layers/paint_layers replace them). Drops prefix+X labels; adds host-assigned letter quick-picks; destructive still confirms via central gate. DONE 2026-07-08 commit 7d031c5, GUI-verified.",
